@startuml activity_create_property_final
title Activity Diagram – Create New Property

|Property Owner|
start
:Start the procedure to create a new property;
:Enter property general details (name, address, description, amenities);
:Confirm the entered data;

|System|
:Validate property data;
if (Data valid?) then (Yes)
  :Send property details to Database;
else (No)
  :Show error message to owner;
  stop
endif

|Database|
:create new Property record;
:create Property Amenities records;

|Storage|
if (Upload media?) then (Yes)
  repeat
    |Property Owner|
    :Select media file;
    |System|
    :Send media file to Storage;
    |Storage|
    :Store media and return reference;
    |Database|
    :Save media reference associated with Property;
  repeat while (Upload more media?)
endif

|System|
:Confirm creation of the complete property;

|Property Owner|
:View the new property in their property list;
stop
@enduml
